<html>
<head>
  <title>Philly Budget Data</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Historical budget data for Philly.">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Philly Budget Data"/>
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="Philly Budget Data"/>
  <meta property="og:description" content="Historical budget data for Philly." />
  <link href="tailwind.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="assets/favicon/apple-touch-icon.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="assets/favicon/favicon-32x32.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="assets/favicon/favicon-16x16.png">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('_menu') %>
<main>
   <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-20 pb-16 text-center lg:pt-32">
      <h1 class="mx-auto italic max-w-4xl font-display text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-7xl">
      Philly <span class="text-blue-800">Budget</span> Data
      </h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg tracking-tight text-slate-700">
      This website provides both visualizations of the Philadelphia city budget as well as raw budget data from 2016 - 2026.</p>
   </div>
   <section class="bg-slate-50 py-20 sm:py-32">
     <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl md:text-center">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Open Budget bubble charts</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg tracking-tight text-slate-700">The following visualisations are built off the the City of Philadelphia's <a href="https://github.com/CityOfPhiladelphia/open-budget">open budget</a> implementation, based on a project by <a class="text-blue-800" href="https://github.com/tpreusse/open-budget">OpenData.ch</a>, the Swiss division of the <a class="text-blue-800" href="http://okfn.org/" rel="nofollow">Open Knowledge Foundation</a>.</p></div>
        <div class="hidden lg:mt-20 lg:block">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-x-8" role="tablist" aria-orientation="horizontal">
              <div class="relative">
                <a href="charts/bubble/2027-tagged.html">
                  <img src="assets/images/2027-proposed.jpg" />
                  <h3 class="font-display mt-2 text-slate-900 text-xl">2027 Proposed Budget</h3>
                </a>
              </div>
              <div class="relative opacity-75 hover:opacity-100">
                <a href="charts/bubble/2027-by-fund.html">
                  <img src="assets/images/2027-proposed-by-fund.jpg" />
                  <h3 class="font-display mt-2 text-slate-900 text-xl">2027 Proposed Budget by Funding Source</h3>
                </a>
              </div>
              <div class="relative opacity-75 hover:opacity-100">
                <a href="charts/bubble/2018.html">
                  <img src="assets/images/2018-proposed-by-fund.jpg" />
                  <h3 class="font-display mt-2 text-slate-900 text-xl">2018 Proposed Budget by Funding Source</h3>
                </a>
              </div>              
          </div>
        </div>
   </section>
</main>







</body>
</html>